                                    <h1>ITD GrowthLabs Jewelry Brand Pricing Tiers (2026) | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #ff5722;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#ea580c;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD JEWELRY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live jewelry vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for jewelry brands</a> with a delivered <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Fabelia jewelry D2C case study</a>, 8+ published jewelry playbooks including <a href="/resources/Gold_vs_Diamond_Jewelry_D2C_Strategy_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Gold vs Diamond D2C Strategy</a>, <a href="/resources/Jewelry_D2C_Digital_Transformation_India_Dubai_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jewelry D2C Digital Transformation India + Dubai</a>, <a href="/resources/Best_D2C_Jewellery_Brands_UAE_GCC_2026_2027.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Best D2C Jewellery Brands UAE + GCC</a>, and city-specific jewelry marketing pages across <a href="/services/gcc/dubai-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/abu-dhabi-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Abu Dhabi</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/dammam-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dammam</a>, and <a href="/services/gcc/al-khobar-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Al Khobar</a>. Every framework below is grounded in live category work &mdash; not generic D2C theory.</div><p>ITD GrowthLabs jewelry engagement pricing follows a 3-tier model matched to brand revenue + sub-vertical + geography scope. Transparent tier structure with defined deliverables + team + KPIs + reporting cadence per tier + ad spend on top (transparent pass-through, no markup).</p><p>This piece walks through what each tier includes, who it fits, and how to choose the right tier.</p>
                                    <h2>Starter Growth tier &amp;mdash; Rs 75,000 / month retainer</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Founder-led jewelry brands (Rs 25L-2 Cr revenue). Boutique fashion + silver + emerging fine + men's. India-only or single-market.</p><p><strong>What is included:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Shopify + WooCommerce foundation optimisation + schema deployment</li><li>Google Business Profile optimisation (1 hub)</li><li>1 paid channel (Google Search OR Meta) managed</li><li>12 Instagram posts + 8 Reels / month + community management</li><li>Basic WhatsApp Cloud API setup + booking + tracking flow</li><li>Basic SEO foundation + BIS + HUID compliance display</li><li>Monthly review call + monthly report</li><li>Slack channel for real-time communication</li></ul><p><strong>Team:</strong> 2-3 person pod (strategist + performance marketer + content coordinator) + shared senior review.</p><p><strong>Ad spend guidance:</strong> Rs 60K-Rs 2 lakh / month typical.</p><p><strong>KPIs tracked:</strong> Website traffic, Meta / Google impressions + clicks + conversions, WhatsApp funnel entries, Instagram engagement, monthly revenue attribution.</p>
                                    <h2>Growth tier &amp;mdash; Rs 2,00,000 / month retainer</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Mid-market jewelry D2C (Rs 2-25 Cr revenue). Fine + fashion + bridal + lab-grown + international-facing brands.</p><p><strong>What is included:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Everything in Starter, plus:</li><li>Google Search + Shopping + PMax + Meta Ads + Instagram + Pinterest paid campaigns</li><li>Influencer sourcing + management (5-10 collabs / month)</li><li>24 pieces / month content (video + static + Reels + Stories)</li><li>WhatsApp Cloud API funnel + video consultation booking + broadcast</li><li>6 blog articles + 1 case study / month for SEO compounding</li><li>Weekly Slack + email reporting + monthly QBR</li><li>Landing pages + CRO A/B tests unlimited</li><li>LinkedIn light-touch (if bridal + enterprise-adjacent)</li></ul><p><strong>Team:</strong> 3-4 person dedicated pod (strategist + performance marketer + creator + content editor + community + WhatsApp specialist) + senior founder-strategist involvement on strategy + monthly QBR.</p><p><strong>Ad spend guidance:</strong> Rs 2-10 lakh / month typical.</p><p><strong>KPIs tracked:</strong> All Starter metrics + LTV / CAC / payback / cohort + attribution across channels + wishlist + retention + WhatsApp NRR lift.</p>
                                    <h2>Enterprise (India + GCC + International) tier &amp;mdash; Rs 5,00,000+ / month retainer</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Multi-region + luxury jewelry (Rs 25 Cr+ revenue). Fine + bridal + luxury + international-diaspora + celebrity-partnership brands.</p><p><strong>What is included:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Everything in Growth, plus:</li><li>India + GCC (UAE + Saudi + Qatar + Kuwait + Oman + Bahrain) + international (US + UK + Canada + Australia + Singapore) simultaneous coverage</li><li>Arabic + Hindi + English creative production (native-speaker writers + editors + video captioners)</li><li>Snapchat + TikTok (GCC) + LinkedIn ABM (enterprise + luxury) + programmatic display</li><li>In-house video pod for brand hero + product + Live Shopping production</li><li>Celebrity + luxury influencer partnerships + wedding-blogger network across regions</li><li>PR + industry-publication placements (Vogue India + Vogue Arabia + Femina + Grazia + trade publications)</li><li>Dedicated 5-10 person pod + Founder-strategist involvement on quarterly QBR</li><li>Board-ready quarterly reports + investor-grade LTV / CAC / cohort attribution</li></ul><p><strong>Team:</strong> 5-10 person dedicated pod including senior strategist + performance marketing pod (multi-channel + multi-region) + creator + content editor + WhatsApp + video pod + community + PR + influencer specialist.</p><p><strong>Ad spend guidance:</strong> Rs 8-30 lakh+ / month typical.</p><p><strong>KPIs tracked:</strong> Everything in Growth + brand-search lift + share-of-voice + PR + editorial pipeline + celebrity engagement metrics + region-specific revenue attribution.</p>
                                    <h2>Ad spend billing &amp;mdash; transparent pass-through, always</h2>
                                    <p>Ad spend is separate from retainer + billed as transparent pass-through:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Option A:</strong> Client pays Google + Meta + LinkedIn + Snapchat + Pinterest + Snapchat + Shopify Ads directly via own credit card. Agency has ad-account access for management + reporting.</li><li><strong>Option B:</strong> Agency pays platforms via own credit card + bills client exactly what was spent + monthly attribution report. No markup ever.</li></ul><p>Bundled + markup-inclusive quotes (common in the industry) hide 15-30% ad-spend markup. We do NOT do this. Ad spend transparent pass-through is contract-critical + non-negotiable.</p>
                                    <h2>How to choose the right tier</h2>
                                    <p>Decision matrix:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Rs 25L-2 Cr / month revenue + single-market + limited catalogue:</strong> Starter (Rs 75K/mo).</li><li><strong>Rs 2-25 Cr / month revenue + multi-channel + mid-catalogue:</strong> Growth (Rs 2L/mo).</li><li><strong>Rs 25 Cr+ / month revenue + multi-region + enterprise + luxury:</strong> Enterprise (Rs 5L+/mo).</li><li><strong>VC-backed startup at Rs 5+ Cr / month revenue:</strong> Growth or Enterprise depending on scale + geography.</li><li><strong>Pre-launch or first 6 months:</strong> Starter tier + upgrade to Growth once revenue proven + ad spend ramping.</li></ul><p>Tier upgrades are seamless (mid-quarter or annually) as brand scales. Downgrade path also supported if scaling stalls.</p>

                                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #fff;">
                                        <h3 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px;">Ready to Get Started?</h3>
                                        <p style="color:#ccc;margin-bottom:25px;">Book a free 30-minute jewelry D2C discovery call. We map your brand + funnel + share a customised proposal within 3 working days.</p>
                                        <a href="https://www.itdgrowthlabs.com/contact-us.php" style="background:#ff5722;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;">Contact Us Today</a>
                                        <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="js-book-call" data-source="blog_cta" style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;">Book Free 30-min Call</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does ITD GrowthLabs charge for jewelry brand marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>3-tier: Starter Rs 75,000 / month (Rs 25L-2 Cr revenue), Growth Rs 2,00,000 / month (Rs 2-25 Cr), Enterprise Rs 5,00,000+ / month (Rs 25 Cr+). Ad spend on top of retainer + transparent pass-through billing (no markup).</p>
                                        <h3>What is included in ITD's Starter tier for jewelry brands?</h3>
                                        <p>Shopify optimisation + Google Business Profile + 1 paid channel + 12 Instagram posts + 8 Reels / month + basic WhatsApp Cloud API + SEO + BIS/HUID display + monthly review. 2-3 person pod + shared senior review. Ad spend Rs 60K-2L / month typical.</p>
                                        <h3>What is included in ITD's Growth tier for jewelry brands?</h3>
                                        <p>Everything in Starter, plus: full Google + Meta + Instagram + Pinterest paid campaigns + influencer management (5-10 collabs/month) + 24 content pieces / month + WhatsApp + video consultation + 6 blogs + 1 case study / month + weekly reporting + monthly QBR + landing pages + CRO. 3-4 person dedicated pod + senior founder-strategist. Ad spend Rs 2-10L/month.</p>
                                        <h3>What is included in ITD's Enterprise tier for jewelry brands?</h3>
                                        <p>Everything in Growth, plus: India + GCC + international simultaneous coverage + Arabic + Hindi + English creative + Snapchat + TikTok (GCC) + LinkedIn ABM + in-house video pod + celebrity + luxury influencer + PR + industry-publication placements + board-ready quarterly reports. 5-10 person dedicated pod. Ad spend Rs 8-30L+/month.</p>
                                        <h3>Is ad spend included in the retainer or separate?</h3>
                                        <p>Separate + transparent pass-through billing. Client pays platforms directly via own credit card (with agency management access), OR agency pays + bills exactly what was spent with monthly attribution report. No markup ever. Bundled + markup-inclusive quotes common in industry but we don't do this.</p>
                                        <h3>Can we upgrade or downgrade tiers?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes seamless mid-quarter or annually as brand scales. Upgrade: brand hits Rs 2 Cr / month revenue + wants full multi-channel Growth tier. Downgrade path also supported if scaling stalls. Contract terms accommodate tier flexibility.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the minimum contract commitment?</h3>
                                        <p>6-month master service agreement with month-to-month cancellation after month 3 if agreed milestones missed. Standard notice period 30 days. Encourages fit assessment + accountability without indefinite lock-in.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD's pricing compare to other jewelry marketing agencies?</h3>
                                        <p>See our <a href="/resources/itd_vs_top_jewelry_d2c_agencies_comparison.php">ITD vs top jewelry agencies comparison</a> for feature + tier + pricing landscape. Our positioning: category-broad D2C agency with proven jewelry vertical track record (Fabelia + 8+ playbooks + GCC city pages) at competitive tier pricing + transparent ad-spend billing.</p>
